cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "research-knowledge-graph: 科研文献知识图谱自动构建工具"
abstract: >-
  一个从科研文献中自动构建领域知识图谱的 Python 工具包，支持中英文文献的实体抽取、
  关系识别、图谱构建、交互可视化与研究脉络分析，可用于文献综述自动化、研究趋势识别、
  研究空白发现与团队知识库构建。
type: software
authors:
  - name: "XJH10247"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/XJH10247/research-knowledge-graph"
url: "https://github.com/XJH10247/research-knowledge-graph"
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - scientific literature
  - information extraction
  - relation extraction
  - research trends
  - literature review
  - natural language processing
  - networkx
